arms.append((i, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule4_8same_side\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.all(np.diff(z[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            alarms.append((i, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule5_6increasing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alarms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pchart_limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_bar, n, k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    se </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(p_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_bar) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> se), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> se)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pchart_limits</code> 里的 <code>max(0.0, ...)</code> 不是可选的修饰：二项比例的下限不可能是负数，Wald 型公式会给出负数下界，这与 NIST 对 Wilson 区间的推荐理由一致（见 <a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc241.htm\">NIST 7.2.4.1</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批次归因\">批次归因</h2><h3 id=\"三类可用的关联维度\">三类可用的关联维度</h3><p>告警说「这个商品的续航负面率异常」，但真正能修的是「某一批次的电芯有问题」。批次归因就是把这个缝隙补上。可用的关联维度有三类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>订单与生产批次</strong>：如果平台能拿到批次号（GS1 标准体系中批次由应用标识符 AI (10) 承载，与 GTIN 共同构成可追溯单元），就能把评论按批次分组，看负面率是否在某批次上显著集中。</li>\n<li><strong>时间窗口</strong>：新批次到货与上架有明确的时间点，评论的尖峰如果起点与该时间点吻合，是强证据。</li>\n<li><strong>仓储与物流路径</strong>：某些问题（外壳开裂、受潮）与运输路径相关，按仓库或承运商分组能暴露出来。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"多重比较必须校正\">多重比较必须校正</h3><p>归因的统计形式是<strong>分组比较</strong>：把候选批次组与其余样本做比例差异检验，并对多重比较做校正（同一时间段可能有几十个候选组）。不做校正时，20 个组里至少出现一次假阳性的概率接近 64%，这是批次归因里最常见的错误。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 批次维度上的负面率与样本量，供差异检验使用&#10;select spu_id,&#10;       batch_no,&#10;       count(*) filter (where polarity = &#39;negative&#39;) as neg_cnt,&#10;       count(*)                                     as total_cnt,&#10;       round(count(*) filter (where polarity = &#39;negative&#39;)::numeric&#10;             / nullif(count(*), 0), 4)              as neg_rate,&#10;       min(ts)::date as first_seen,&#10;       max(ts)::date as last_seen&#10;from insight.aspect_instance&#10;where aspect_l2 = :aspect&#10;  and ts &gt;= :window_start&#10;group by spu_id, batch_no&#10;having count(*) &gt;= 5          -- 少于 5 条不进入检验，避免小样本噪声&#10;order by neg_rate desc;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 批次维度上的负面率与样本量，供差异检验使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spu_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       batch_no,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> polarity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'negative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neg_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> polarity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'negative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neg_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ts)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_seen,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ts)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_seen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> insight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">aspect_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aspect_l2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :aspect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :window_start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">group by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spu_id, batch_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">having</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          -- 少于 5 条不进入检验，避免小样本噪声</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neg_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>having count(*) &gt;= 5</code> 这一行是关键的小样本保护。批次维度天然稀疏（一个批次可能只有几条评论），不设下限会让最小的组永远排名靠前。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警聚合与派发\">告警聚合与派发</h2><h3 id=\"按根因聚合而非按商品\">按根因聚合而非按商品</h3><p>一个根因可能在多个商品、多个市场上同时触发告警。如果每条告警单独派单，质量团队会在一天内收到几百条重复工单，然后开始忽略它们——这是预警系统最常见的死法。</p>\n<p>聚合的维度是<strong>根因 + 责任团队</strong>，而不是商品。具体做法：把候选告警按 <code>rootcause_id</code> 归组，统计受影响的 SPU 数、市场数与评论总量，用总量而不是单条告警决定优先级。一个只在单个 SKU 上出现、评论量很小的告警应当进入低优先级队列，而不是立刻派单。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>响应时限</th>\n<th>通知渠道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>安全相关根因，任意量级</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>电话 + 值班群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>根因波及 ≥3 个 SPU 或 ≥2 个市场</td>\n<td>当日</td>\n<td>告警群 + 工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>单 SPU 且 n_eff ≥ 30 的持续偏移</td>\n<td>3 个工作日</td>\n<td>工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>小样本候选或新主题</td>\n<td>周报汇总</td>\n<td>报表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"安全类根因的免统计白名单\">安全类根因的免统计白名单</h3><p>P0 的判定不能依赖统计判据——安全相关（电池鼓包、漏液、短路）的评论即使只有 1 条也必须立即人工介入。把这类根因单独维护成一份<strong>免统计白名单</strong>，是必须的设计而不是过度保守。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预警判据应当是「偏离自身基线」而不是绝对阈值，否则旺季误报、淡季漏报。</li>\n<li>控制图基线至少 25 个观测点；评论稀疏的长尾商品按品类共享基线。</li>\n<li>默认启用 WECO 第 1、3、4、5 条；误报率从 1/371 升至约 1/91.75，这个取舍需业务方确认。</li>\n<li>比例指标用小样本敏感的 p 图并做方差稳定变换，控制限下限要截断在 0。</li>\n<li>批次归因依赖批次号（GS1 AI (10)）与上架时间对齐，多重比较必须校正。</li>\n<li>告警按「根因 + 责任团队」聚合，按影响量决定优先级；安全类根因走免统计白名单。</li>\n<li>预警的输入质量由 <a href=\"fake-review-insight-filter\">水军噪声剔除对洞察的影响</a> 保障。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质量问题/批次自动预警","id":"质量问题-批次自动预警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"控制图的判据与阈值","id":"控制图的判据与阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"单点 3σ 与模式判据","id":"单点-3-与模式判据"},{"level":3,"text":"六条 WECO 规则与误报代价","id":"六条-weco-规则与误报代价"},{"level":2,"text":"基线建立与自适应更新","id":"基线建立与自适应更新"},{"level":3,"text":"基线样本量与洁净期","id":"基线样本量与洁净期"},{"level":3,"text":"比例指标的控制限陷阱","id":"比例指标的控制限陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"批次归因","id":"批次归因"},{"level":3,"text":"三类可用的关联维度","id":"三类可用的关联维度"},{"level":3,"text":"多重比较必须校正","id":"多重比较必须校正"},{"level":2,"text":"告警聚合与派发","id":"告警聚合与派发"},{"level":3,"text":"按根因聚合而非按商品","id":"按根因聚合而非按商品"},{"level":3,"text":"安全类根因的免统计白名单","id":"安全类根因的免统计白名单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"差评主题聚类与根因归类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/review-text-insight-analytics/negative-rootcause/negative-cluster-rootcause"},"next":{"title":"水军噪声剔除对洞察的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/review-text-insight-analytics/negative-rootcause/fake-review-insight-filter"}}